            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>It has recently become apparent that a few trainees in Acute Internal Medicine (IM) have not been made aware of what the final outcome of their training might be. There is a need, therefore, to ensure that there are no surprises for individuals as they approach the end of training.</AbstractText>
